              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">200f7b85-94ec-4c44-a0ec-47f9727c68ad</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Woodie · Timber preview</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">WOODIE | TIMBER PREVIEW

Use a millimetre Rhino document.
Choose Product / Appearance on Timber Material.
The triangle below its icon hides the controls.

Flat and bowed boards: same centreline length,
500 x 27 mm section; 220 mm bow rise.
Guide Curve controls longitudinal grain.

Visual presets only: changing Product does not
change geometry or specify a manufactured layup.</item>
                  </items>
