                    <item name="Advanced" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Click the arrow beneath the icon to show or hide material controls. Choose a product and appearance; expand Advanced inputs for overrides. Resolution is in mm/pixel. Appearance inspired by Larsson et al. (2022), Procedural Texturing of Solid Wood with Knots. ACM Transactions on Graphics 41(4), Article 45 (SIGGRAPH 2022). https://doi.org/10.1145/3528223.3530081. Cut-aware procedural detail informed by Larsson et al. (2024), https://doi.org/10.1111/cgf.15074, and Mokume (2025), https://doi.org/10.1145/3730874; independent adaptation.</item>
