                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Preview Rhino geometry as straight or bent timber. Appearance inspired by Larsson et al. (2022), Procedural Texturing of Solid Wood with Knots. ACM Transactions on Graphics 41(4), Article 45 (SIGGRAPH 2022). https://doi.org/10.1145/3528223.3530081. Cut-aware procedural detail informed by Larsson et al. (2024), https://doi.org/10.1111/cgf.15074, and Mokume (2025), https://doi.org/10.1145/3730874; independent adaptation.</item>
